  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DCM Itau Green Bond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The most significant expected Project-level outcome is increased access to climate finance in Brazil by growing Itaus climate-smart auto loan portfolio. Beyond the Project, IFC anticipates that it will contribute toward sustainability by catalyzing additional banks to (i) provide climate finance for climate smart vehicles through capacity-building, demonstration and replication channels and (ii) structure and issue green Letras Financeiras in the local capital markets of Brazil.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment consists of the subscription of a green local instrument denominated Letra Financeira, a type of security exclusively for financial institutions,&#xA0; up to the equivalent in BRL of US$200 million to be issued by Itau Unibanco S.A. (Itau or the Bank), . The Letras Financeiras will be used to support the Banks lending to climate-smart vehicles in order to widen access to finance for the acquisition of climate-smart vehicles in Brazil.</narrative>
  </description>
